    "text": "<p>In the structure of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CuSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> only one water molecule, which is outside the brackets (coordination sphere), is hydrogen-bonded. The other four molecules of water are coordinated.</p><p><img height=\"129\" src=\"assets\\st0168_6425e67e7904.png\" width=\"319\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
